[1m[38;5;231mWhat should "track" actually do with it?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mconsole.log only[39m
     [38;5;246mKeep it in-process, matching the current stub style. No new module.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Send to an analytics endpoint
